  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-素材管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\"],\"capability_summary\":\"代理商可根据代理商ID、任务结果、任务状态、任务创建时间等条件筛选并获取前测任务列表。需通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。返回码和返回信息详见【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"diagnosis_task.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/agent/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"/open_api/获取Access token接口路径/\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"title\":\"代理商获取任务列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iVtDzpT8\">代理商获取前测任务列表</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1799124160092169%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%221eKU7%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VNMMVKSU\" id=\"h346b9f0-VNMMVKSU\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-dgRHhaNC\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/agent/list/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/diagnosis_task/agent/list/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1816970967050522\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-eGmVFu9G\" id=\"h346b9f0-eGmVFu9G\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-pbqSjdZE\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-e9VbFXHz\" id=\"h346b9f0-e9VbFXHz\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-MRTyTPEe\" id=\"h346b9f0-MRTyTPEe\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">agent_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">代理商ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">results</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">根据任务结果筛选 允许值：\nFIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL 首发素材\nNON_FIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL 非首发素材\nAD_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL AD优质素材\nNON_AD_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL AD非优质素材\nECP_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL 千川优质素材\nNON_ECP_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL 千川非优质素材<p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4dmx2ldyhci00\">可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-IeF4SL2F\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Z58VYRFF\"><code>AD_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> AD画风<br/>优质素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BSbGHimO\"><code>ECP_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 千川画风<br/>优质素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oPUaSUhb\"><code>FIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL</code> 首发素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Fj5Y905X\"><code>NON_AD_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> AD画风<br/>非优质素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qjrml2HC\"><code>NON_ECP_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 千川画风<br/>非优质素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qQMHUUOB\"><code>NON_FIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL</code> 非首发素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-k5v3ehz7axo00\"><span style=\"color: #323335;\"></span><code>LOCAL_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 本地推画风<br/>优质素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-azotnaoi7so00\"><code>NON_LOCAL_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 本地推画风<br/>非优质素材</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3axxgbbpmd000\"><br/></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">根据任务状态筛选，允许值：\nPENDING SUCCESS FAILED 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-QYd5VbjP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rGGWRrAn\"><code>FAILED</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RWvddKvX\"><code>PENDING</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5BjhV18a\"><code>SUCCESS</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-StdRcTep\">根据任务创建时间进行过滤的起始时间，与end_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">根据任务创建时间进行过滤的截止时间，与start_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd<p data-id=\"p838747a-ePPYtyvr\">start_time和end_time 时间跨度最大30天</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LmQsVPSf\">页码，默认值1</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-snhuFRoE\">页面大小，默认值20，最大100</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_date_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">根据任务创建时间进行过滤的起始时间，优先级高于start_time，与end_date_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_date_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">根据任务创建时间进行过滤的截止时间，优先级高于end_time，与start_date_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-bNPLW9Ah\" id=\"h346b9f0-bNPLW9Ah\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Fdiagnosis_task%2Fagent%2Flist%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20agent_id%20%3D%20AGENT